  "releaseNotes": "v1.2.3: Enhanced Quantum Algorithms and Builder API Improvements\n- NEW: Shor's Algorithm backend execution support (ShorsBackendAdapter.fs)\n- NEW: Quantum Phase Estimation (QPE) backend execution support (QPEBackendAdapter.fs)\n- NEW: Quantum Arithmetic operations (QuantumArithmetic.fs) with addition, subtraction, multiplication\n- NEW: 5 new builder APIs for advanced quantum algorithms (QuantumTreeSearchBuilder, QuantumConstraintSolverBuilder, QuantumPatternMatcherBuilder, QuantumArithmeticBuilder, QuantumPeriodFinderBuilder, QuantumPhaseEstimatorBuilder)\n- IMPROVED: Computation expression syntax for all builder APIs (tree {}, constraint {}, pattern {}, arithmetic {}, period {}, phaseEstimator {})\n- IMPROVED: Consistent API design across all quantum solvers with idiomatic F# patterns\n- FIXED: Builder API composition and backend switching reliability\n- DOCS: Updated examples for Shor's Algorithm and QPE\n- Status: 912+ tests passing, production-ready for advanced quantum algorithms",
